### Pagamento real via Asaas (spec: asaas-payment FR-07, Fluxo 7)
# Use com o "REST Client" do VS Code ou o HTTP Client do JetBrains. Nenhum segredo aqui: preencha
# as variáveis com os valores do seu `.env` (sandbox) na hora de usar.
@base = http://localhost:3433
@asaas = https://api-sandbox.asaas.com/v3
@apiKey = COLE_AQUI_A_ASAAS_API_KEY
@webhookToken = COLE_AQUI_O_ASAAS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN
@publicUrl = https://SEU-TUNEL.ngrok-free.app
@orderId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
@chargeId = pay_000000000000

### Instruções de pagamento de um pedido pendente (QR Pix, copia-e-cola, fatura)
GET {{base}}/sponsorships/{{orderId}}/payment

### Pedido (com Asaas, confere o status da cobrança no gateway antes de responder)
GET {{base}}/sponsorships/{{orderId}}

### Cadastra o webhook no Asaas (uma vez por ambiente; FR-07). `url` é a URL pública do backend.
POST {{asaas}}/webhooks
access_token: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apuração Brutal — patrocínios",
  "url": "{{publicUrl}}/webhooks/asaas",
  "email": "seu-email@exemplo.com",
  "enabled": true,
  "interrupted": false,
  "sendType": "SEQUENTIALLY",
  "authToken": "{{webhookToken}}",
  "events": ["PAYMENT_CONFIRMED", "PAYMENT_RECEIVED", "PAYMENT_REFUNDED"]
}

### Lista os webhooks cadastrados
GET {{asaas}}/webhooks
access_token: {{apiKey}}

### (Apenas sandbox) simula o pagamento da cobrança de um pedido
POST {{asaas}}/sandbox/payment/{{chargeId}}/confirm
access_token: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Status da cobrança no Asaas
GET {{asaas}}/payments/{{chargeId}}/status
access_token: {{apiKey}}

### Exemplo de evento entregue pelo Asaas ao backend (para testar o endpoint localmente)
POST {{base}}/webhooks/asaas
asaas-access-token: {{webhookToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_exemplo_local_1",
  "event": "PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
  "dateCreated": "2026-10-25 20:05:00",
  "payment": {
    "object": "payment",
    "id": "{{chargeId}}",
    "externalReference": "{{orderId}}",
    "value": 10.00,
    "billingType": "PIX",
    "status": "RECEIVED"
  }
}
